@startuml
title Golang + Lit SSR混合渲染时序图

participant 浏览器 as Browser
participant "Golang/Iris服务" as GoService
participant "Node.js Lit SSR微服务" as NodeSSR
participant Redis as Cache
participant 数据库 as DB

activate Browser
Browser -> GoService: HTTP GET /dashboard
activate GoService

GoService --> GoService: 路由判断页面类型
alt 简单页面（无复杂组件）
    GoService -> DB: 查询基础数据
    activate DB
    DB --> GoService: 返回数据
    deactivate DB

    GoService -> GoService: 使用html/template渲染
    GoService --> Browser: 返回纯HTML
else 复杂页面（含Lit组件）
    GoService -> NodeSSR: RPC调用SSR服务\n(component=user-profile, props)
    activate NodeSSR

    NodeSSR -> Cache: 检查渲染缓存[component+props]
    activate Cache
    alt 缓存命中
        Cache --> NodeSSR: 返回缓存的HTML片段
    else 缓存未命中
        NodeSSR -> DB: 获取组件依赖数据
        activate DB
        DB --> NodeSSR: 返回组件数据
        deactivate DB

        NodeSSR -> NodeSSR: 执行Lit SSR渲染
        NodeSSR -> Cache: 存储渲染结果\n(缓存5分钟)
        NodeSSR --> NodeSSR: 生成带hydration标记的HTML
    end
    deactivate Cache

    NodeSSR --> GoService: 返回SSR结果HTML
    deactivate NodeSSR

    GoService -> GoService: 注入动态数据到HTML
    GoService --> Browser: 返回完整HTML\n(含<script>window.__DATA__)
end

deactivate GoService

Browser -> Browser: 执行Lit hydration\n连接事件/恢复状态
deactivate Browser

@enduml